       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SPECNAME.
       AUTHOR. FIXTURES.
       INSTALLATION. TEST.
       SECURITY. NONE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. X86.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. X86 MEMORY SIZE 8192 WORDS.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           ALPHABET STD-ALPHA IS STANDARD-1
           CLASS HEX-DIGIT IS "0" THRU "9" "A" THRU "F"
           CLASS VOWEL IS "AEIOU"
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-AMT         PIC S9(3)V99 VALUE -12,5.
       01 WS-HEX         PIC X(4) VALUE "1F0A".
       01 WS-WORD        PIC X(3) VALUE "AEI".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY WS-AMT " " 2,25 " " -0,5.
           ADD 1,25 TO WS-AMT.
           DISPLAY WS-AMT.
           IF WS-HEX IS HEX-DIGIT DISPLAY "hex" END-IF.
           MOVE "1G" TO WS-HEX.
           IF WS-HEX IS NOT HEX-DIGIT DISPLAY "not hex" END-IF.
           IF WS-WORD IS VOWEL DISPLAY "vowels" END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
